{"id":"W0e772275068bfd91298580a2","zh":"轴箱加速度","en":"","name":"轴箱加速度","language":"zh","domain":"车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W0e772275068bfd91298580a2","text":"轴箱加速度","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S95a020df5ff4ecc431fa","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"上述研究主要就轴箱加速度、轨道不平顺与铁路线路上的单一轨道病害(如焊缝不平或短波磨耗等)进行分析,列车动态响应与轨道状态及病害的系统性相关研究仍需不断深入。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sda2ba52afc2f7d08f903","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"目前,从列车动力响应角度进行反馈式轨道(路基或桥)病害诊断和状态评估研究的文献资料还较少,国内外学者主要就轴箱加速度与轨道不平顺的相关规律进行研究,康熊等通过对轴箱垂向加速度带通滤波 [2],利用共振解调方法实现高速铁路焊接接头状态动态评判;杨文忠等详细研究了轴箱加速度与轨面高低不平顺的相关性 [3];宁静等利用EMD和Cohen核信号处理方法 [4],在有效抑制二次分布交叉项的基础上,进行基于轴箱加速度信号的轨道不平顺分析;BRACCIALI A,GRASSIE S和HEMPELMANN K等利用轴箱加速度诊断钢轨磨耗 [5~7]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P048":{"id":"P048","title":"Vibration-based damage detection of rail fastener using fully convolutional networks","authors":"M Chen, W Zhai, S Zhu, L Xu, Y Sun","year":"2022","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2021.1896010","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 60 (7), 2191-2210","label":"Chen等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-vibration-based-damage-detection-of-rail-fastener-using-fully-convolutional-networks"},"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"直接反映轮轨激扰、用于辨识细微病害的振动响应。","language":"zh","source_id":"P102","paper_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"随车获取的振动响应，是扣件状态识别的主要输入。","language":"zh","source_id":"P048","paper_slug":"2022-vibration-based-damage-detection-of-rail-fastener-using-fully-convolutional-networks","title":"基于全卷积网络的钢轨扣件振动损伤检测","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"车辆轴箱测点的加速度响应。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 车辆—轨道与基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C423008b427fd92b8b97d"},{"text":"车辆轴箱部位的加速度响应，在文中用于轨道状态及病害分析。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"Cfbd28143ec92a4daca0a"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W0a42fce480658e85e10d9944","name":"axle box accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W56fb3e017ac3b0b9c25d009d","name":"axle-box acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wdbd1e0a6a00fa2001c0af50a","name":"Axle box acceleration (ABA)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W0a42fce480658e85e10d9944","name":"axle box accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W56fb3e017ac3b0b9c25d009d","name":"axle-box acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wdbd1e0a6a00fa2001c0af50a","name":"Axle box acceleration (ABA)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W0a42fce480658e85e10d9944","name":"axle box accelerations","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null},{"id":"W56fb3e017ac3b0b9c25d009d","name":"axle-box acceleration","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wdbd1e0a6a00fa2001c0af50a","name":"Axle box acceleration (ABA)","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P102","title":"小波能